  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/46e53276-323c-4fc1-9e55-ddde7ca00ea7-136.png\" style=\"width: 227px; height: 217px;\" /></p><p>The length of the median&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></math>&nbsp;is given by&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>49</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>36</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mn>112</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Now, let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mi>T</mi></math>&nbsp;be the tower of height&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi></math>&nbsp;and it subtends&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>&nbsp;at the vertex&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/0fd99f88-40a0-4a6d-9182-af92659f7b90-137.png\" style=\"width: 256px; height: 142px;\" /></p><p>Then, in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;we have&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>T</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>h</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mn>21</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
